# Task model selection

Use this mapping for per-task model switching. Suggest the listed model when the user’s task clearly matches a row.

| Task type | Model |
|-----------|--------|
| Architecture decisions, compliance reasoning | **claude-sonnet-4-6** |
| High-complexity cross-framework gap assessments, grading | **gemini-4-argon** (`thinking_level="high"`) |
| Document ingestion & ontology mapping (indirect prompt injection defense) | **gemini-4-argon** (`thinking_level="medium"`) |
| Boilerplate, repetitive code, tests | **claude-haiku-4-5** (faster, cheaper) |
| Complex multi-file refactors | **claude-sonnet-4-6** |

- **Gemini 4 Argon** for cross-framework compliance gap analysis, rubric grading, and adversarial document parsing with context caching.
- **Sonnet** for reasoning-heavy architecture decisions and cross-file coherence.
- **Haiku** for formulaic work (boilerplate, repetitive code, tests) to save cost and latency.
- Default to **claude-sonnet-4-6** or **gemini-4-argon** when the task is ambiguous or high-stakes.
